From f13c4d1985890f38b857fba1328903207da5f6de Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: x <x@x>
Date: Mon, 19 Oct 2026 14:30:54 +0300
Subject: [PATCH 905/947] topaz-0113: embedded GPU firmware, step markers

---
 iokit/Kernel/arm/TopazAdreno.cpp   |   28 +-
 iokit/Kernel/arm/TopazAdrenoFw.cpp | 2606 ++++++++++++++++++++++++++++
 iokit/conf/files.arm64             |    1 +
 3 files changed, 2621 insertions(+), 14 deletions(-)
 create mode 100644 iokit/Kernel/arm/TopazAdrenoFw.cpp

diff --git a/iokit/Kernel/arm/TopazAdreno.cpp b/iokit/Kernel/arm/TopazAdreno.cpp
index b812ebd..a2b5cd3 100644
--- a/iokit/Kernel/arm/TopazAdreno.cpp
+++ b/iokit/Kernel/arm/TopazAdreno.cpp
@@ -32,6 +32,8 @@ void topaz_fw_free(void *data, size_t size);
